title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: Masyumi_Fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: Masyumi_Fundraising_timer += 4; week_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
card-image: img/ blank
tags: Masyumi_party

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the organization cannot exist without money.

- @increase_dues: Increase dues.
- @maintain_dues: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce_dues: Reduce dues.

@increase_dues
subtitle: [+ Masyumi_dues + 1 +] resources gained. [? if m_dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: Masyumi_dues += 1; Masyumi_resources += Masyumi_dues;
view-if: Masyumi_dues <= 1000

We have increased the dues.

@maintain_dues
subtitle: [+ Masyumi_dues +] resources gained. [? if Masyumi_dues = 0 : So nothing got, I guess. ?]
on-arrival: Masyumi_resources += Masyumi_dues;

We maintain our current dues.

@decrease_dues
subtitle: [+ Masyumi_dues - 1 +] resources gained. [? if Masyumi_dues <= 0 : I suppose we are losing money instead. ?]
on-arrival: Masyumi_dues -= 1; Masyumi_resources += Masyumi_dues;
view-if: Masyumi_dues <= -1000

We have decreased the dues.
